    },
    {
      "id": 2,
      "from_id": 2,
      "from_name": "Olivia",
      "to_id": 1,
      "to_name": "Emily",
      "content": "Yeah, Emily! It's been quite a while since I've seen you. I've been working late and I missed our chats. How have you been? Any good updates or moments of peace during your recent travels?",
      "created_at": "2026-10-02T05:46:27.610459+00:00"
    },
    {
      "id": 3,
      "from_id": 1,
      "from_name": "Emily",
      "to_id": 2,
      "to_name": "Olivia",
      "content": "How have you been? Anything good happening?",
      "created_at": "2026-10-02T05:46:50.049000+00:00"
    },
    {
      "id": 4,
      "from_id": 2,
      "from_name": "Olivia",
      "to_id": 1,
      "to_name": "Emily",
      "content": "I've been well, thank you for asking! It's been pretty busy with work lately. I've been traveling quite a bit and visiting friends and family. But I'm glad to hear that you're enjoying your travels too!",
      "created_at": "2026-10-02T05:47:14.780844+00:00"
    },
    {
      "id": 5,
      "from_id": 1,
      "from_name": "Emily",
      "to_id": 2,
      "to_name": "Olivia",
      "content": "Oh wow, I'm so happy to hear that!",
      "created_at": "2026-10-02T05:48:24.689039+00:00"
    },
    {
      "id": 6,
      "from_id": 2,
      "from_name": "Olivia",
      "to_id": 1,
      "to_name": "Emily",
      "content": "Oh wow, Emily! That is really heartwarming to hear from you. How have you been on your travels? Any special places you've visited or unique experiences you've had?",
      "created_at": "2026-10-02T05:49:12.580235+00:00"
    },
    {
      "id": 7,
      "from_id": 1,
      "from_name": "Emily",
      "to_id": 2,
      "to_name": "Olivia",
      "content": "Oh wow, I'm so glad to hear that! I've been traveling a lot lately and visiting some amazing places. Have you ever gone there? What would it be like?",
      "created_at": "2026-10-02T05:50:46.082179+00:00"
    },
    {
      "id": 8,
      "from_id": 2,
      "from_name": "Olivia",
      "to_id": 1,
      "to_name": "Emily",
      "content": "Oh wow, Emily! That is really heartwarming to hear from you. Have you been on any amazing journeys recently? I'd love to hear about them too!",
      "created_at": "2026-10-02T05:51:23.148584+00:00"
